<section class="admin-panel" id="panel-availability" data-admin-panel="availability">
	<div class="panel-heading"><div><h2>Días no disponibles</h2><p>Selecciona un día para marcarlo como ocupado o volver a habilitarlo. Los domingos siempre están cerrados.</p></div></div>
	<div class="availability-calendar"><div class="calendar-toolbar"><button id="admin-calendar-prev" type="button" aria-label="Mes anterior">←</button><h3 id="admin-calendar-month"></h3><button id="admin-calendar-next" type="button" aria-label="Mes siguiente">→</button></div>
		<div class="calendar-weekdays" aria-hidden="true"><span>L</span><span>M</span><span>X</span><span>J</span><span>V</span><span>S</span><span>D</span></div>
		<div class="calendar-days" id="admin-calendar-days"></div>
		<p class="availability-hint"><span class="availability-dot"></span> Ocupado <span class="availability-dot available"></span> Disponible <span class="availability-dot closed"></span> Domingo cerrado</p>
	</div>
</section>
